"A simple gluten free sauce sandwich.  Not very filling but beats eating just"
" the bread... especially if it is the wrong type of bread!"
msgstr "单一调味酱的无麸质三明治。比起面包夹面包好得多。特别是当那些面包还有麸质的时候……"

