"It's a two-liter plastic bottle that can hold a lot of soda, or, nowadays, "
"boiled water."
msgstr "一个能够容纳两升的塑料瓶，可以装很多汽水，或者就以后而言，开水。"

#: lang/json/CONTAINER_from_json.py
