"A pewter bowl without a lid.  Can be used as a container or as a tool.  "
"Holds 250 ml of liquid."
msgstr "一只小小的无盖锡罐，可以作为容器或工具。能储存250毫升的液体。"

#: lang/json/CONTAINER_from_json.py
msgid "plastic bowl"
