"An aluminum can, like what soda comes in.  This one is opened and can't be "
"easily sealed."
msgstr "一个铝罐，就是装饮料的那种。这个已经被打开了而且没法简单的重新密封。"

#: lang/json/CONTAINER_from_json.py
msgid "vacuum-packed bag"
msgid_plural "vacuum-packed bags"
msgstr[0] "真空包装袋"

