"nevermind."
msgstr "一把叉子，你可以用它叉起你想吃的任何食物放进你的嘴里，但目前为止还是更直接的方式去吃要好一些。"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "spoon"
msgid_plural "spoons"
msgstr[0] "勺子"

#. ~ Description for spoon
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Do not try to bend the spoon.  That is impossible."
msgstr ""
"一个喝汤盛饭所用的用餐工具。\n"
"\"试图用念力折弯它是不可能的。\""

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "spork"
msgid_plural "sporks"
msgstr[0] "叉勺"

#. ~ Description for spork
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
