"light during long-running tasks that require it such as crafting or reading,"
" but not (for example) if you are simply waiting nearby."
msgstr ""
"放置于标记为柴火源地块上的柴火和可燃物会在需要时自动为附近的火堆补充燃料。用于在长时间制造物品或阅读时为满足光照条件而自动补充燃料，玩家只是待在火堆旁边时不会自动补充燃料。"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Mark practice target"
msgstr "标记练习目标"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mark a spot for target practice.  Firing will automatically target the first"
" practice target location found in gun range, if no enemies are around."
msgstr "标记一块地作为射击练习目标。当你射程内没有敌人时，射击时会自动锁定射程内所发现的第一个射击练习目标。"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Butchering Rack"
msgstr "建造屠宰架"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Junk Metal Barrier"
msgstr "建造废旧金属墙"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Reinforce Junk Metal Wall using bolts"
msgstr "用螺栓加固废旧金属墙"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Reinforce Junk Metal Wall using spot-welds"
msgstr "用点焊加固废旧金属墙"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Junk Metal Floor"
msgstr "建造废旧金属地板"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Pillow Fort"
msgstr "建造枕头堡垒"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Pine Lean-To"
msgstr "搭建松枝棚屋"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Tarp Lean-To"
msgstr "搭建防水帆布棚屋"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Wattle-and-Daub Wall"
msgstr "建造木骨泥墙"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Thatched Roof"
msgstr "建造茅草屋顶"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Repair Wattle-and-Daub Wall"
msgstr "修理木骨泥墙"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Fire Ring"
msgstr "建造火塘"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Build Tarp Rain-Catcher"
msgstr "搭建防水帆布集雨器"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Harvest Blob Feed from Corpse Pit: Smash to Harvest"
msgstr "从填满尸体的坑中收获变形怪培养物：砸碎来收获"

#: lang/json/construction_from_json.py
msgid "Harvest Blob Feed from Slime: Smash to Harvest"
msgstr "从粘液中收获变形怪培养物：砸碎来收获"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about lizards."
msgstr "你做了一个关于蜥蜴的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange scaly feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种全身长满鳞片的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about being a patient in a frightening hospital."
msgstr "你做了一个被禁闭在恐怖医院里的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you an oddly medicated feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种嗑了药的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about birds."
msgstr "你做了一个关于飞鸟的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange feathered feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种全身长出羽毛的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about fish."
msgstr "你做了一个关于鱼的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet, scaly feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身潮湿和长出鳞片的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about animals."
msgstr "你做了一个关于动物的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身长毛的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about bears."
msgstr "你做了一个关于熊的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a rough furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身毛乎乎的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about cats."
msgstr "你做了一个关于猫的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a sleek furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身毛绒绒的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about wolves."
msgstr "你做了一个关于狼的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a thick furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身毛糙糙的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about cattle."
msgstr "你做了一个关于牛的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange content, furry feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身长毛且满足的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about insects."
msgstr "你做了一个关于昆虫的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange chitinous feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种长出甲壳的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about plants."
msgstr "你做了一个关于植物的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange plantlike feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种像植物一样的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about slime."
msgstr "你做了一个关于变形怪的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange slimy feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身黏糊糊的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about living in a cave."
msgstr "你做了一个关于洞穴生活的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give a strange reclusive feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种与世隔绝的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about sea creatures."
msgstr "你做了一个关于海洋生物的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种浑身潮湿的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about spiders."
msgstr "你做了一个关于蜘蛛的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange webbed feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种被网包围的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream about rats."
msgstr "你做了一个关于老鼠的怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange fuzzy feeling."
msgstr "你的梦给你一种毛茸茸的奇怪感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel... OK."
msgstr "你感觉……不错。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel a yearning..."
msgstr "你内心有种渴望……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream about the zoo, for some reason."
msgstr "你不知道为什么，梦到了动物园。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams... are complex and multifaceted."
msgstr "你的梦……复杂而多变。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of the tropics."
msgstr "你梦到热带雨林。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel warm."
msgstr "你感觉到一阵暖流。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of a massive block of cheese bigger than you."
msgstr "你梦见一大块比你整个人还大的奶酪。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of being cozy in a dark place."
msgstr "你梦见在黑暗中的你更加自在。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of a strange quest for a bush that grows gray apples."
msgstr "你梦见自己正在奇怪地寻找一种能够长出灰色苹果的灌木丛。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel like you're cracking a combination lock."
msgstr "你梦见自己好像在破解一把组合锁。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow cancel each other out, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会相互抵消，不是吗？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Red, blue, and yellow add together, don't they?"
msgstr "红色，蓝色，黄色会混在一起，不是吗？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of bathing in the sun on a rock."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，梦里你在岩石上晒太阳。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "梦里，你看见自己像蜥蜴一样的独特身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of undergoing strange medical procedures."
msgstr "你做了一个令人不安的梦，好像接受了诡异的医疗手术。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving "
"treatment."
msgstr "在梦里，你看到自己穿着病号服，被强行治疗。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦里你飞翔在天空中。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "In a dream, you see a curiously birdlike reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鸟一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of swimming in the open ocean"
msgstr "你梦见自己在海洋里遨游。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "In your dream, you see a strangely fishlike image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见自己奇怪的像鱼一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "你做了一个在树林里打猎的生动的梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像野兽般的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of foraging in the woods... mouth-first?"
msgstr "你梦见自己在丛林中搜寻草料……还用的嘴？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dream-reflection is rather bearish."
msgstr "在梦里，你不自觉地用熊的方式思考。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You easily bound from the street to a roof..oh, only a dream."
msgstr "你纵身一跃，从大街上跳到了屋顶……啊，只是个梦而已。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "As you dream, your reflection looks rather catlike."
msgstr "在梦中，你不自觉地走起了猫步。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of someone invading your territory."
msgstr "你做了一个不愉快的梦——有人侵犯了你的领地。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dream-self's muzzle looks... wait, muzzle?"
msgstr "你梦见自己带着嘴套……等等，嘴套？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of grazing in an open field."
msgstr "你梦见自己在旷野中吃草。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In a dream you catch a glimpse of a strangely cattle-like image of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你惊鸿一瞥看到了一只很奇怪的牛牛——看着它你就感觉像是在看着自己。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a dream of working in a hive."
msgstr "你做了一个梦，梦见自己在一个巢穴中行走。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid "
"reflection."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像昆虫一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a confusing dream of growing in a garden."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，在梦中你正在一个花园中茁壮成长。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are confused by a plantlike image of yourself in a dream."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像植物一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream of living in sludge."
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己生活在一个烂泥潭中。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "In your dream you see an odd, slimy reflection of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像软泥一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of living deep inside a dark cave."
msgstr "你梦见你生活在一个很深很黑的山洞里。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of being a primitive cave dweller."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一个原始穴居人。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of living on the ocean floor."
msgstr "你梦见自己生活在深海之中。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr "在梦里，你发现自己的倒影几乎就和一只章鱼一模一样。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a strange dream of spinning webs"
msgstr "你做了一个奇怪的梦，梦见自己在吐丝做网。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "In your dream you see a very spiderlike version of yourself."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己奇怪的像蜘蛛一样的身影。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在下水道里。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "In your dream you see a group of rats that look almost like yourself."
msgstr "在你的梦中，你看到了一群和你自己长的差不多的老鼠。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dream of having that success you knew you deserved, back before all "
"this."
msgstr "你梦到自己回到了过去的世界，幸福地追求自己的梦想。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dream-self looks competent and in control."
msgstr "在梦里，你看见了自己非常能干而冷静，一切尽在掌握。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of a home in the forests."
msgstr "你做了一个生动鲜明的梦，梦见自己生活在森林之中。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel beautiful, and yet riven with worry..."
msgstr "你梦见自己很漂亮，但又被烦恼所撕裂……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can't quite work out what the dream is about... it just keeps changing."
msgstr "你不太能理解你的怪梦……它不停的在变幻。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "你的梦境充斥了各种生物，而且你看上去和它们都有点像。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dream of stalking some sort of lizard... no, that can't be right, can "
"it?"
msgstr "在梦中，你悄悄地跟踪着一群蜥蜴……不，这不正常吧，不是吗？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems "
"to help..."
msgstr "不知为何，你梦见了自己的鞋子。它们再也不合脚了，而且无论如何都帮不了你……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of... sneaking."
msgstr "你梦见你在……潜行。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of a cold winter night.  Your jacket is too big to put on."
msgstr "你梦见一个寒冷的冬夜。你的夹克太大了，穿不上。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming a lizard hybrid."
msgstr "你很惊恐的梦到自己变成了一个蜥蜴人。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a disturbingly lifelike dream of living as a lizard."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人困惑很逼真的梦，梦见自己俨然如一只蜥蜴一样活着。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a dream of doctors and nurses doing unnatural things to your body, "
"which brings you perverse pleasure."
msgstr "你做了一个怪梦。医生和护士对你的身体动了一个非常恐怖手术，但是给了你一种奇特的快感。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs "
"with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr "你做了一个与医疗异常现象有关的生动的梦，在梦中你的心跳与平稳的静脉点滴同步化了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a realistic dream of flying south with your flock for the winter."
msgstr "你做的一个逼真的梦，梦里在和一群伙伴为了躲避寒冬一起向南飞着。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are disturbed when your birdlike dreams are more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成一只飞鸟，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了，这让你心烦意乱。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a disturbing dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个令人困扰的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr "当你醒来的时候，骤然感觉到一阵窒息，就像鱼儿跳出水面的感觉一样。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和狼伙伴们合作追捕一只猎物。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "A terrifyingly real dream has you killing game with your bare teeth."
msgstr "一场真实而恐怖的梦境，你梦见自己正在用锋利的獠牙咬穿猎物的喉咙。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your... muzzle in "
"anticipation."
msgstr "梦中，你疯狂的跪舔着一个蜂巢……当然，如预料一般带着口套。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stalk and kill a young wolf, using only your teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr "梦中，你悄悄地杀死了一只幼狼——只用牙齿和爪子。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A warm, sunny spot high up where you can watch your prey.  What a great "
"dream!"
msgstr "你在一个温暖，阳光明媚的高地俯视着你的猎物。真是一个美梦啊！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of pursuing and killing a rat, for some reason."
msgstr "梦里，你追逐并杀掉了一只老鼠……不过为什么？"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of tearing into a fresh kill."
msgstr "你梦见自己的爪子撕碎了新鲜的猎物。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of finally finding the perfect place to make your den."
msgstr "梦中，你终于找到了絮窝的理想地点。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "你做了一个很糟糕的梦，梦见自己正被农夫领着走向屠宰场。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You find it hard to wake from a vivid dream of grazing on a farm."
msgstr "你很不情愿的从一个逼真的梦中醒来，梦中你安静地吃着草。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of serving the hive queen mindlessly."
msgstr "你很惊恐地从梦中醒来，梦中你变成了一个没有自主意识、服务于蜂后的工蜂。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr "你做了一个很令人不安而又十分逼真的梦，梦中你在给花儿授粉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a confusing and scary dream of becoming a plant."
msgstr "你做了一个困惑而吓人的梦，梦见自己变成了一株植物。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The transition from your lifelike dreams of living as a plant to reality "
"shocks you."
msgstr "梦里变成一株植物的感觉正在逐渐变为现实，这种感觉让你毛骨悚然。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a slime blob frightens you."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己变成了一只变形怪，太恐怖了！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find it hard to control your limbs after dreaming of amorphous blob "
"life."
msgstr "你从变成变形怪的梦中醒来以后，发现自己几乎无法控制自己的四肢了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr "你梦见自己在黑暗中生活了很多很多年，这种感觉以假乱真。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are frightened of the outside after your vivid dream of cave life."
msgstr "从穴居生活的生动梦境中醒过来后，你发现自己很怕在户外活动了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your dreams of living on the ocean floor seem more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "你梦见自己生活在海床上，梦境中的场景变得比现实世界还要真实了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of living as a terrifying octopus mutant."
msgstr "你梦见自己变成了一只很吓人的章鱼变异人。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正趴在网上畅享美味昆虫。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams of fully turning into a spider frighten you."
msgstr "你梦见自己已经完全变成了一只蜘蛛！吓死爹了！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "你梦见自己正在被一只猫追捕，太吓人了！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your lifelike dreams have you scavenging food with a pack of rats."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和一群老鼠伙伴搜寻食物。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "你梦见了五年后的自己，一位成功的受人敬仰的市长。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your success in restoring civilization was only a dream.  For now."
msgstr "你成功地重建了人类文明，但它暂时只是一个梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "NO!  You will not allow this corruption to prevail!"
msgstr "不！你不会让这腐化战胜自己的！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "你在梦中看见了自己美丽的身影，森林的美景全都在你身上映射出来。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are many animals, and yet one."
msgstr "你是无数动物的集合体，然而你还是你。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Hoof.  Talon.  Tooth.  Fight.  Feed.  Forward."
msgstr "巨蹄。利爪。尖牙。战斗。进食。前进。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "你从来没有感到如此轻盈，强大。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After an exciting and tasty hunt, you retire to your nest.  Mmm, yes, nest."
msgstr "在一场激动人心、美味多汁的狩猎之后，你回到了你的爱巢。嗯，是的，\"巢\"。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas "
"station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream..."
msgstr "你在丧尸的腿间穿梭，它们根本抓不住身材小巧的你。加油站就在眼前，以及里面的汽水和薯片还有——呃，是个梦……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once you finish your tasty dinner of seeds, you look around for your drink, "
"but you already ate it."
msgstr "你吃完了美味的种子，环顾四周寻找饮料，但你突然想起你只需靠吃东西就可以解渴。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You are terrified by a dream of becoming an ape hybrid."
msgstr "你惊恐的梦到自己变成了一个杂交猿。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You blissfully recall days spent lounging in the sun."
msgstr "你愉快的梦到在太阳底下的日子。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dream of your legions of undead admirers, their attentions, and the "
"wonderful pain."
msgstr "你梦到了那一大群无数不死崇拜者，它们对你的关注，以及那美妙的痛苦感觉。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "你梦见你在纠结自己建造的鸟巢是否足够结实。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your dream of soaring over the landscape becomes a nightmare when you find "
"yourself with arms and a glider!"
msgstr "你梦见自己翱翔蓝天，俯瞰美景，而你发现自己还有着手臂和滑翔器，这个梦变成了梦魇。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a comforting dream of swimming with a school of fish."
msgstr "你做了一个治愈系的梦，梦见自己在和一群小鱼伙伴们一起畅游。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The thought of being out of water, forced to crawl unsupported, terrifies "
"you."
msgstr "你梦见自己被捉出水面，在地上不停扑腾，这个噩梦吓坏了你。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "你很生动的梦见自己正在和伙伴们合作追捕一只猎物。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "A fond memory of throating some prey animal bubbles up."
msgstr "一段咬开猎物喉咙的美妙回忆出现在你的梦里。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were "
"just a legend..."
msgstr "你在梦中四处寻找那些可以\"嘴接鲑鱼\"的地方，或者那只是一个传说……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Ah, the wolf-slaying dream again.  That's a good one..."
msgstr "哈，又是一个杀狼的梦。这个还不错……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Boing!  and you've pounced another yummy critter."
msgstr "扑通！你又抓到了一个美味的可怜虫。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your nightmare of sentient rats turns successful, as you grab their King and"
" shake it apart!"
msgstr "在梦中你最终成功地成了所有聪明老鼠们的梦魇，你抓住了鼠王，并把它撕成了碎片！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of the hunt, the feed, and your pack."
msgstr "你梦到了捕猎，进食，还有你的狼群。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Oh, you should really patrol your territory again, maybe expand."
msgstr "哦，你真心需要再次巡逻你的领地了，或许是时候扩张下领地了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of jumping the gate and leading your herd to freedom."
msgstr "你梦到你带领你的族群跃过大门奔向自由。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "The herd moves along and you with them, finding greener pastures."
msgstr "兽群不断的前进，奔向更加青翠的草场，你是其中之一。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You feel smug, knowing that the Queen is dependent on you."
msgstr "想想蜂后都需要依靠自己，你不禁有几分自得。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dream of a weirdly shaped plant, whose nectar surpassed your every "
"wish..."
msgstr "你梦到一株奇形怪状的植物，其花蜜如同琼浆玉露，超过了你的幻想……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of bees fighting over your sweet nectar.  Mmm."
msgstr "你梦到一群蜜蜂为了你甘甜的花蜜而争斗。感觉真好。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rather attractive triffid offers you a bouquet of ape heads.  How "
"thoughtful!"
msgstr "一个富有魅力的三尖树送了你一束\"猿\"脑袋，太体贴了！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your vivid dream of your pseudopods calcifying into rigid structures "
"terrifies you."
msgstr "你十分逼真地梦见自己的假足钙化成了坚硬结构，太可怕了！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ah, the painting-the-planet dream again.  Maybe if you assimilated more..."
msgstr "啊，又是关于\"星球染色\"的梦。或许你应该进一步同化下……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The years seem to fly past as you dream of carving great underground "
"fastnesses."
msgstr "你在梦中构筑牢固的地下要塞，时光飞逝，度年如日。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You have a horrible nightmare of being caught out in the sunlight."
msgstr "在一个恐怖的噩梦中，你被扔到了阳光里。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Mmm.  The shellfish dream again.  Yum!"
msgstr "嗯……又是这个贝壳梦。好美味！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You dream of recruiting a cult of fishfolk to serve your needs."
msgstr "你梦见自己招募了一群鱼人邪教徒来为你服务。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You excitedly web up an interloper and prepare to feast... nope, dream."
msgstr "你兴奋地网住了一个闯入者，准备享用盛宴……呃，一个梦而已。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your dreams of having to live without a web frighten you."
msgstr "梦到过着没有网的生活，你被吓到了。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "The Fury is so big!  It's GONNA GET YOAAAAAH! *pant* only a dream."
msgstr "哇，这只毛绒绒的猫猫怎么这么大！它马上就要把我……哇哇哇哇！*啪嗒*还好只是一个梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You find your paws twitching.  There's a cave.  You should go."
msgstr "你梦到自己爪子交错着，那有个洞，你应该钻进去。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You dream of the peaceful world you'll give humankind.  Because no one else "
"can."
msgstr "你梦到了自己将给人类带来的大同世界，舍我其谁！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "There are underground Faults in the world.  Faults you should remedy."
msgstr "这个世界隐藏着许多\"缺陷\"，一些需要你来纠正的\"缺陷\"。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr "你被真菌正在摧毁你的家园的噩梦惊醒了，气喘吁吁！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle..."
msgstr "你希望别人能理解你对森林的爱，并和你一起奋斗……"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected... oh, just a dream."
msgstr "你觉得体内的血液流动地比你预期中要快……哦，只是一个梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "FIGHT.  FEED.  FORWARD."
msgstr "战斗！进食！前行！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "Oh.  No, that 'rex' thing was only a myth."
msgstr "哦，不。那些所谓\"霸王龙\"只是一场梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr "你好失落，你那些刚刚孵化的漂亮幼崽只是一场梦。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You curl up some more in your nest.  Geez, shredded paper really *is* comfy."
msgstr "你继续蜷缩在你的巢穴中。哎呀，碎纸真的是舒服。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall."
"  Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr "你又听见警笛了，但是这次你藏在你墙中的洞穴中。没人会想到在这里寻找！"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "We have been waiting a long time for a place such as this."
msgstr "吾等为此时此地已等待多时。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid "We will raise bountiful orchards and beautiful gardens."
msgstr "吾等将建起丰美的果园及美丽的花园。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The walking plants seek to harness us as a food source.  We will not allow "
"that."
msgstr "那些会走路的植物把吾等当作食物。吾等将阻止它们。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our colonists are limitless.  We shall adapt to this world, as we adapt to "
"all."
msgstr "吾等开拓者无穷无尽。吾等将改造这个世界，一如吾等所曾改造过的所有一切。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with "
"broad-minded guidance."
msgstr "非马卡斯们有时会排斥马洛斯莓。吾等开拓者应以慈悲为怀，引导其实现繁荣。"

#: lang/json/dream_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The seething masses attempt to wall non-Mycus away from the Marloss.  We "
"will adapt and defeat them."
msgstr "狂信之众试图将非马卡斯们与马洛斯莓隔绝开来。吾等会适应并击败它们。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Hit By Player"
msgstr "被玩家攻击"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Hit By Player'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are hit by player.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被玩家击中。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Docile Monster"
msgstr "驯服的怪物"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Docile Monster'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for when monsters are tamed.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被驯服。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Controlled Monster"
msgstr "受控怪物"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Controlled Monster'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are being controlled by another.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被精神控制。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Hit-and-run Running"
msgstr "尝试逃跑"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Hit-and-run Running'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag for when hit-and-run monsters run away.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：尝试逃跑。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Counting Down"
msgstr "倒计时"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Counting Down'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for monster's counting down.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：怪物倒计时。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "No ammo"
msgstr "无弹药"

#. ~ Description of effect 'No ammo'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag used to stop a monster reviving with ammo.  This is a bug if you have"
" it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：阻止怪物复活时携带弹药。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked to Lead"
msgstr "被要求带路"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked to Lead'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for asking to lead NPCs.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求带路。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked to Follow"
msgstr "被要求跟随"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked to Follow'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag for asking to NPCs to follow you.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求跟随。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked to Train"
msgstr "被要求训练"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked to Train'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for asking to NPCs to train you.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求训练。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked to socialize"
msgstr "被要求闲聊"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked to socialize'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag: for having recently asked an NPC to socialize.  This is a bug if you"
" have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求闲聊。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked Info"
msgstr "被要求个人信息"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked Info'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag for asking to NPCs for personal information.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求个人信息。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Asked for Item"
msgstr "被要求物品"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Asked for Item'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for asking NPCs for items.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求物品。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Currently Busy"
msgstr "当前正忙"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Currently Busy'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI cooldown tag for items or services.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：道具或服务的计时器。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Already Gave Quest Item"
msgstr "已获得的任务道具"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Already Gave Quest Item'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag to prevent you from getting multiple quest items.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：阻止获得重复任务道具。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Catch Up"
msgstr "被要求跟上"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Catch Up'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for telling NPCs to catch up.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：要求跟上。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Allow to Sleep"
msgstr "允许入睡"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Allow to Sleep'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag for telling NPCs to sleep.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：让NPC入睡。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Said Something Recently"
msgstr "刚刚对话"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Said Something Recently'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag to control NPC verbosity.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：控制NPC长对话。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Infection"
msgstr "感染"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Infection'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag used for the infected NPC quest.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：感染任务。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Pet"
msgstr "宠物"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Pet'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag used for pet critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：宠物。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Pacified"
msgstr "被安抚"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Pacified'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag used for pacified critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被安抚。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Has Bag"
msgstr "拿着包包"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Has Bag'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag used for critters holding your bags.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：拿着你的包包。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Tied Up"
msgstr "被捆绑"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Tied Up'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag used for tied up critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：被捆绑。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Shrieking"
msgstr "尖叫中"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Shrieking'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "AI tag used for screecher sounds.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：尖叫。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Turret is Targeted"
msgstr "炮塔已瞄准"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Turret is Targeted'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag used for turret targeting sounds.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：炮塔已瞄准。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Bounced"
msgstr "反弹"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Bounced'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag used for bouncing ammo targeting.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：活跃弹药锁定。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Pushed"
msgstr "被推开"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Pushed'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AI tag used for monsters pushing each other.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "AI专用标签：怪物们互相推挤。"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Downed"
msgstr "被击倒"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Downed'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You're knocked to the ground.  You have to get up before you can move."
msgstr "你倒在了地板上，你必须爬起来才能继续移动。"

