"A barrier made of sharp barbed wire.  More persuasive brother of wire fence."
msgstr "一扇由锋利的带刺铁丝制成的网状围栏。比它的铁丝网兄弟的说服力要高那么一点。"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "rope fence"
