#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "Recover Hide Relay"
msgstr "召回同伴（补给藏匿点）"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to forage for edible plants.\n"
" \n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A \n"
"Foraging Possibilities:\n"
"> wild vegetables\n"
"> fruits and nuts depending on season\n"
"May produce less food than consumed!\n"
"Risk: Very Low\n"
"Time: 4 Hours, Repeated\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"说明：\n"
"选择一名同伴去搜寻野果。\n"
"\n"
"技能：生存\n"
"需求等级：N/A\n"
"可能的收集物：\n"
"> 野菜\n"
"> 根据季节产出各种水果坚果\n"
"> 产出可能低于任务所消耗的食物！\n"
"\n"
"风险：极低\n"
"耗时：4小时/次，可重复\n"
