#, c-format
msgid ""
"Fearful that he may be an agent of some hostile faction, %s doesn't mention "
"the camp."
msgstr "由于担心他可能是某个敌对派系的斥候， %s 并未透露任何关于幸存者营地的消息。"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
msgid "The two part on friendly terms and the survivor isn't seen again."
msgstr "两人友好地交流完之后各自离开，从此再也没人遇见过那个神秘的幸存者。"

