msgid "The multi-cooker runs away!"
msgstr "多功能厨师机逃跑了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "You're surrounded by aggressive multi-cookers!"
msgstr "你被敌对的多功能厨师机包围了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "The multi-cooker should be finishing shortly..."
msgstr "多功能厨师机很快就要完工了……"

#. ~ sound of a multi-cooker finishing its cycle!
#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "ding!"
msgstr "叮！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "You cannot read, and don't understand the screen or the buttons!"
msgstr "你不识字，所以你根本无法理解屏幕和按钮的意思！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Welcome to the RobotChef3000.  Choose option:"
msgstr "欢迎使用机器厨师3000型。请选择："

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Stop cooking"
msgstr "停止烹调"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Batteries are low."
msgstr "电量低。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Start cooking"
msgstr "开始烹调"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Upgrade multi-cooker"
msgstr "升级多功能厨师机"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Multi-cooker already upgraded"
msgstr "多功能厨师机已被升级"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Multi-cooker unable to upgrade"
msgstr "多功能厨师机无法升级"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Take out dish"
msgstr "装盘"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Really stop cooking?"
msgstr "真的停止烹饪？"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You got the dish from the multi-cooker.  The %s smells delicious."
msgstr "你把 %s 从厨师机中取出。这闻起来真香。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You got the %s from the multi-cooker."
msgstr "你把 %s 从厨师机中取出。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Choose desired meal:"
msgstr "选择你想要的餐饮："

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The multi-cooker needs %d charges to cook this dish."
msgstr "多功能厨师机需要消耗 %d 单位电量来烹饪这道菜肴。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid ""
"The screen flashes blue symbols and scales as the multi-cooker begins to "
"shake."
msgstr "随着显示屏闪过蓝色的符号，多功能厨师机开始振动。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You need a %s."
msgstr "你需要一个 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You need an item with %s of 1 or more to disassemble this."
msgstr "你需要一个 %s 等级至少为1的工具来拆解它。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid ""
"You've successfully upgraded the multi-cooker, master tinkerer!  Now it "
"cooks faster!"
msgstr "你成功的升级了多功能厨师机，大师级工匠！现在它烹饪得更快了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid ""
"You sagely examine and analyze the multi-cooker, but don't manage to "
"accomplish anything."
msgstr "你精细的检查和分析了多功能厨师机，但是什么都没干成。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid ""
"Your tinkering nearly breaks the multi-cooker!  Fortunately, it still works,"
" but best to stop messing with it."
msgstr "你的捣鼓要把多功能厨师机弄坏了！幸运的是，它还能用。你最好少乱动它了。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Using cable:"
msgstr "使用电缆："

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Attach cable to vehicle"
msgstr "连接电缆至载具"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Attach cable to self"
msgstr "连接电缆至自身"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Attach cable to solar pack"
msgstr "连接电缆至太阳能背包"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Attach cable to vehicle where?"
msgstr "在载具的哪里连接电缆？"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Attach loose end of the cable"
msgstr "接驳电缆一端"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Detach and re-spool the cable"
msgstr "拆除并重卷电缆"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s already has access to its own electric system!"
msgstr "%s 已经连接到它自己的电气系统了！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You link up the electric systems of the %1$s and the %2$s."
msgstr "你把 %1$s 和 %2$s 的电气系统连接了起来。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "You need soap to use this."
msgstr "你需要一些肥皂来使用它"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's monitor slowly outputs the data..."
msgstr "%s 的监测装置缓慢地输出了数据……"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s reads %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s 显示为 %2$s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You need to wear the %1$s before activating it."
msgstr "在使用 %1$s 前需要先穿上它。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Choose hologram direction."
msgstr "选择全息投影方向。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Can't create a hologram there."
msgstr "无法在此处创建全息投影。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s must be installed in a vehicle before being loaded."
msgstr "%s 必须先安装在载具上才能重新装填。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Error restoring monster: %s"
msgstr "恢复怪物出错：%s"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s holding %s"
msgstr "%s 装着 %s"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "There is no place to put the %s."
msgstr "没有足够的空间放置 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp src/iuse_actor.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Place the %s where?"
msgstr "把 %s 放在哪里？"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You cannot place the %s there!"
msgstr "无法放置 %s！"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Capture what with the %s?"
msgstr "用 %s 抓什么？"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You cannot use a %s there."
msgstr "无法在此处使用 %s。"

#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s is too big to put in your %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s 对你的 %2$s 来说太大了！"

