#, c-format
msgid "The %s flashes a LED and departs.  SWAT's working the area."
msgstr "%s 的LED灯闪烁了一下，然后就解除了部署。让SWAT先上。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s acknowledges you as SWAT onsite, but hangs around to watch."
msgstr "%s 确认了你是名SWAT，但依旧停在周围围观。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s winks a LED and departs.  One machine to another?"
msgstr "%s 的LED灯闪烁了一下，然后就解除了部署。一台又一台？"

