msgid "Apparently yours aren't the only systems kept alive post-apocalypse."
msgstr "显然你不是在大灾变后存活下来的唯一系统。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flashes a LED and departs.  The Feds have this."
msgstr "%s 的LED灯闪烁了一下，然后就解除了部署。让执法官先上。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s takes your picture!"
msgstr "%s 拍下了你的相片！"

