#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Hey, can you hear me?"
msgstr "嘿，能听得见我说话吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Don't touch me."
msgstr "离我远点。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "你叫什么名字？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I thought you were my friend."
msgstr "我还以为你是我的朋友。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "你今天还好吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Shut up! Don't lie to me."
msgstr "闭嘴！别对我说谎！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Please, don't go."
msgstr "求求你，不要走。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Don't leave me alone!"
msgstr "别抛下我一个人！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr "是啊，当然了。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "No way, man."
msgstr "没门，哥们。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Do you really think so?"
msgstr "你真的这么认为吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Is it really time for that?"
msgstr "这真是做这个的时候吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Sorry, I can't hear you."
msgstr "抱歉，我听不见你说话。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You've told me already."
msgstr "你已经告诉过我了。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I know!"
msgstr "我知道！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Why are you following me?"
msgstr "你为什么要跟着我？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "This place is dangerous, you shouldn't be here."
msgstr "这地方太危险了，你不该在这。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "That's not true, is it?"
msgstr "那不是真的，对吧？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Are you hurt?"
msgstr "你受伤了吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Your "
msgstr "你的"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Hey, let's go kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "嘿！我们一起去杀了那个 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Did you see that %1$s!?"
msgstr "你看到那只 %1$s 了吗！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "I want to kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "我想去杀了那只 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Let me kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "让我去杀死那只 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Hey, I need to kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "嘿，我需要杀了那只 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "I want to watch that %1$s bleed!"
msgstr "我想给那只 %1$s 放放血！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Wait, that %1$s needs to die!"
msgstr "等等，那只 %1$s 必须死！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Go kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "去杀死那只 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Look at that %1$s!"
msgstr "快看那只 %1$s！"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s doesn't deserve to live!"
msgstr "那只 %1$s 死到临头了！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Hey, you're bleeding."
msgstr "嘿，你在流血。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Your wound looks pretty bad."
msgstr "你的伤口看起来很糟糕。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Shouldn't you put a bandage on that?"
msgstr "难道你不应该用绷带包扎下吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Please don't die! No one else lets me kill things!"
msgstr "请不要死了！没有其他人能让我大开杀戒了！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You look hurt, did I do that?"
msgstr "你看起来受伤了，是我干的吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Are you supposed to be bleeding?"
msgstr "你这大概是在流血吧？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You're not going to die, are you?"
msgstr "你不是快要死了吧？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Kill a few more before you bleed out!"
msgstr "在你流干血前再多杀点怪！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Hey fix me up."
msgstr "嘿，帮我修一修。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I need healing!"
msgstr "我需要你的治疗！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I hurt all over..."
msgstr "我全身到处都痛……"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You can put me back together, right?"
msgstr "你能够把我拼回去的，对吧？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I... I can't move my legs!"
msgstr "我……我的腿动不了了！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Medic!"
msgstr "医生！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I can still fight, don't replace me!"
msgstr "我还可以继续战斗，别把我换掉！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "They got me!"
msgstr "还是被它们给伤到了！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Go on without me..."
msgstr "不用管我，你继续吧……"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Am I gonna die?"
msgstr "我会死吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Let me kill something already!"
msgstr "快让我杀点什么东西吧！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I'm your best friend, right?"
msgstr "我是你最好的朋友，没错吧？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Do you think it will rain today?"
msgstr "你觉得今天会下雨吗？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "Try not to drop me."
msgstr "请试着不要丢下我。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "How many do you think we've killed?"
msgstr "你认为我们杀死了多少人？"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "I'll keep you safe!"
msgstr "我会保护你的！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You get a bad feeling."
msgstr "你的心情突然很糟糕。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You suddenly feel so numb..."
msgstr "你突然感到麻木……"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You start to shake uncontrollably."
msgstr "你开始不由自主地颤抖。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"Get away from there!\""
msgstr "\"离这儿远点！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"What do you think you're doing?\""
msgstr "\"你以为你在干什么？\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"Stop laughing at me!\""
msgstr "\"不要嘲笑我！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"Don't point that thing at me!\""
msgstr "\"别把那东西指着我！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"Stay away from me!\""
msgstr "\"别靠近我！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"No! Stop!\""
msgstr "\"不！停下！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"Get the fuck away from me!\""
msgstr "\"你他妈的快滚开！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"That's not true!\""
msgstr "\"那不是真的！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"你想从我这里得到什么？\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"I didn't mean to do it!\""
msgstr "\"我不是故意要这么做！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"It wasn't my fault!\""
msgstr "\"那不是我的错！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"I had to do it!\""
msgstr "\"我只能那么做！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"They made me do it!\""
msgstr "\"都是他们逼我那么做的！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"What are you!?\""
msgstr "\"看看你做的那些好事！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "\"I should never have trusted you!\""
msgstr "\"我就不该相信你！\""

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You're suddenly overcome with the urge to sleep and you pass out."
msgstr "你突然被睡眠的冲动给压倒了，你昏了过去。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You have an asthma attack!"
msgstr "你的哮喘发作了！"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You use your Oxygenator to clear it up, then go back to sleep."
msgstr "你用氧气交换机治疗了哮喘症状并重新睡去。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You use your inhaler and go back to sleep."
msgstr "你使用了你的哮喘吸入器并重新睡去。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "You use your last inhaler charge."
msgstr "你使用了你最后的吸入剂。"

#: src/player.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You use your inhaler, only %d charge left."
msgid_plural "You use your inhaler, only %d charges left."
msgstr[0] "你使用了你的哮喘吸入器。只剩下 %d 次使用次数了。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "The sunlight is really irritating your skin."
msgstr "太阳光让你的皮肤不舒服。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "The sunlight is really irritating your eyes."
msgstr "太阳光让你的眼睛不舒服。"

#: src/player.cpp
msgid "The sunlight burns your skin!"
